<title>FRANCE: French call money eases to 3-3/8 3-1/2 - dealers.</title>
<headline>French call money eases to 3-3/8 3-1/2 - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>- French call money was lowered by 1/16 to 3-3/8 1/2 from 3 7/16 9/16 percent on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The semi-official interest rate is steered closely by the Bank of France.</p>
<p>The drop in call money follows a cut by the Bank of France in the intervention rate to 3.25 percent from 3.35 percent at a money market tender on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
